msgid "这组卡片只处理磁矩或磁序，不替代晶格和原子坐标生成。旋转、倾斜、螺旋和无序卡片通常 需要输入中已经存在有效磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"These cards modify magnetic moments or magnetic order; they do not generate cells or "
"atomic coordinates. Rotation, tilt, spiral, and disorder cards normally require valid"
" magnetic moments in the input."

